def recurse_search(arr, left, right, key):
    """Develop an algorithm to perform a ternary search on a sorted 2D array. The algorithm should be able to handle arrays with varying dimensions (not merely square arrays), that may contain negative numbers and duplicate elements. Also, implement it recursively, ensuring that it prioritizes the lowest number when multiple same-valued elements are found."""

